  "thesis": "Resetting an unlevered BTC and zero-yield cash portfolio to a fixed target at each UTC month boundary may harvest sufficiently broad price reversals and prevent risky-asset weight drift, improving fee-adjusted total PnL and path risk over an equal-capital portfolio that buys the same initial BTC weight and never rebalances.",
  "economic_rationale": "Constant mix is a deterministic countercyclical transfer rather than a forecast: it sells BTC after appreciation and buys after declines. The mechanism is valuable only if reversal harvesting exceeds fees and adverse slippage, matched-capital total PnL improves, drawdown and Calmar do not deteriorate, the effect survives Validation and annual breadth, and the primary fifty-percent result is not a weight cliff. Risk-budget maintenance alone cannot pass.",
  "opportunity_cost": "Resolve whether the passive-weight drift found in the closed static passive-BTC plus DRA family can be controlled by a simpler standalone allocation mechanism before allocating more research to DRA factor admission or portfolio overlays.",
  "uniqueness": {
    "duplicate_family_key": "btc-cash-monthly-constant-mix-40-50-60",
    "prior_result_status": "NO_MATCHED_CAPITAL_RESULT_FOUND_FOR_EXACT_STANDALONE_POLICY",
    "distinct_from_closed_families": [
      "The closed static fifty-percent passive BTC plus fifty-percent DRA policy did not rebalance and included a DRA trading sleeve; this experiment has no DRA logic and compares constant mix directly with the same initial BTC weight plus cash.",
      "The closed monthly volatility-target family changed exposure from lagged realized volatility; this policy uses no price-derived forecast or volatility estimate and always returns to a fixed preregistered weight.",
      "The closed monthly momentum family selected binary long or cash from lagged direction; this policy does not use return direction and never selects a directional state.",
      "The closed range hybrid rotated between DRA and range sleeves; this policy contains one spot BTC asset and zero-yield cash only."
    ],
    "excluded_reinterpretations": [
      "Fifty percent is the primary policy. Forty and sixty percent are stability neighbors only and cannot replace a failed primary result.",
      "No alternate target weight, rebalance frequency, threshold, drift band, cash yield, leverage, short leg, volatility target, DRA sleeve or tax assumption may be scanned after outcome access.",
      "A historical pass remains REPORTED_NOT_ACTIVATED and requires independent sealed OOS."
    ]
  },
